      "start_seconds": 341.64,
      "end_seconds": 357.62,
      "duration_seconds": 15.98,
      "text": "I think podiatry should see you too one warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse in that case don't wait i'd like to see you again in six weeks does all of that make sense?"
